  "text": "AI agents are starting to move real money: refunds, plan changes, credits. They learn how from API docs. But docs and real APIs disagree. We pointed our agent at two real APIs, Crustdata and Dodo Payments. Crustdata's own docs say a company lookup with no match returns an empty result. Live, it returned an error, on three separate documented claims. An agent that trusts the docs breaks on exactly these cases.",
